  "prefLabel": "Ncr 735.05 Trail Uses Not Permitted",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 735.05 Trail Uses Not Permitted.\n\n(a) No person shall obstruct other users of the trail.\n\n(b) Foot and bicycle racing shall not be permitted on the Franconia Notch recreational trail, unless permission has been granted by special use permit pursuant to Ncr 740.\n\nSource. #14055 EMERGENCY, EXPIRED: 2-15-25\n\nNew. #14291, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
